{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"scholars_lodge","model_identifier":"scholars_lodge","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# scholars_lodge\n\n- Cubes: finished 510, construction_0 46, construction_33 205, construction_66 302, ruined 251 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a sandstone hall under a verdigris-green roof, with a two-column portico, pediment and oculus, and a domed observatory tower with a brass telescope. Arched lit windows, a chimney, a lectern and scroll rack under the portico, and a front lawn with benches, hedges, lamps, a sundial, a book cart and a tree.\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `scholars_lodge_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-18, 0, -48)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-50, 113.5, 14)\n- `fx_window_oculus` at (-18, 71, -40)\n- `fx_lantern_1` at (-39, 37.6, -20.4)\n- `fx_lantern_2` at (3, 37.6, -20.4)\n- `fx_lamp_1` at (-31, 25.8, -56.4)\n- `fx_lamp_2` at (-5, 25.8, -56.4)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-56, 33, -13.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (19, 33, -13.6)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-56, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (-30, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-4, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_6` at (18, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_7` at (-69.6, 33, 2)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-69.6, 33, 28)\n- `fx_window_13` at (64.2, 58, -0.7)\n- `fx_window_14` at (71.1, 58, 16)\n- `fx_window_15` at (64.2, 58, 32.7)\n- `fx_window_16` at (47.5, 58, 39.6)"},"resolution":{"width":1024,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"stone_wall#d6c08c","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-68,-0.3,-12],"to":[30,62,40],"autouv":0,"color":8,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[216,0,314,62],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[412,0,464,62],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[314,0,412,62],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[464,0,516,62],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null},"down":{"uv":[608,86,706,138],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"68e48ef5-5b3f-f0b0-459d-6af9c27854be"},{"name":"stone_plinth#b39d6c","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-70,0,-14],"to":[32,6,42],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[211,278,313,284],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[619,278,675,284],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[313,278,415,284],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[675,278,731,284],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,86,102,142],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[102,86,204,142],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8867e342-949b-d1ca-0e65-231b161ed709"},{"name":"stone_plinth_cap#c9b078","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-69.4,5.3,-13.4],"to":[31.5,7.5,41.4],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[914,326,1015,328],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[101,329,156,331],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,329,101,331],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[156,329,211,331],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[204,86,305,141],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,1,1],"texture":null}},"type":"cube","uuid":"dc55fb37-940b-f2f9-15f4-0efc161e207b"},{"name":"stone_course#ecdfb4","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-69.2,30.6,-13.2],"to":[32,33.4,41.2],"autouv":0,"color":7,"origin":[0,