saved":true,"uuid":"5e8f7044-9dc9-5ea1-a48f-f1368b7a8db5","source":"data:image/png;base64,","relative_path":""}],"description":"# scholars_lodge\n\n- Cubes: finished 510, construction_0 46, construction_33 205, construction_66 302, ruined 251 (the state sets are cut from the finished cubes and map into the texture regions of the faces they were cut from).\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a sandstone hall under a verdigris-green roof, with a two-column portico, pediment and oculus, and a domed observatory tower with a brass telescope. Arched lit windows, a chimney, a lectern and scroll rack under the portico, and a front lawn with benches, hedges, lamps, a sundial, a book cart and a tree.\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and footing with materials waiting, then walls rising inside scaffold).\n- `ruined`: broken walls at uneven heights, rubble and fallen beams.\n- `scholars_lodge_damaged.png`: damaged texture (cracks, scorch) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-18, 0, -48)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-50, 113.5, 14)\n- `fx_window_oculus` at (-18, 71, -40)\n- `fx_lantern_1` at (-39, 37.6, -20.4)\n- `fx_lantern_2` at (3, 37.6, -20.4)\n- `fx_lamp_1` at (-31, 25.8, -56.4)\n- `fx_lamp_2` at (-5, 25.8, -56.4)\n- `fx_window_1` at (-56, 33, -13.6)\n- `fx_window_2` at (19, 33, -13.6)\n- `fx_window_3` at (-56, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_4` at (-30, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_5` at (-4, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_6` at (18, 33, 41.6)\n- `fx_window_7` at (-69.6, 33, 2)\n- `fx_window_8` at (-69.6, 33, 28)\n- `fx_window_13` at (64.2, 58, -0.7)\n- `fx_window_14` at (71.1, 58, 16)\n- `fx_window_15` at (64.2, 58, 32.7)\n- `fx_window_16` at (47.5, 58, 39.6)"}